          <strong style="color:white;">Choose a human VA if:</strong> Your business runs on deep, relationship-heavy conversations where emotional nuance and a warm human touch are the whole point, and you can afford the fully loaded cost plus the recruiting and training overhead. A great human VA still beats AI on rapport.<br><br>
          <strong style="color:white;">The honest difference:</strong> A human VA costs $2,000-$3,500/month fully loaded and can't cover nights, weekends, or sick days. BirkyStudio's AI receptionist is $550 once plus about $30-$50/month in call usage, answers 24/7, and never calls in sick. Most businesses end up using both, the AI for the front desk, a human for the relationships.
