        </div>
        <p style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">
          BirkyStudio's AI receptionist is built to do the job a front-desk VA does, answer the phone, catch WhatsApp messages, and qualify leads, but around the clock. The AI Voice Receptionist is a one-time $550 setup, with the client paying Vapi directly for call usage at roughly $30-$50 a month. The AI Text Receptionist for WhatsApp is $297 one-time. Optional support runs $29-$49 a month. There's no contract and no monthly platform fee.
