        </p>
        <p style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">
          For a solo agent or small business, that's the difference between missing a lead at 9pm and closing it. One deal typically pays for the entire setup. And because it's a one-time cost with no lock-in, you can pair it with a human VA for the relationship work without doubling your payroll.
        </p>
