        <h3 style="color:white;font-size:1.3rem;margin-bottom:16px;">Hiring a Human Virtual Assistant</h3>
        <p style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">
          A good real estate virtual assistant is genuinely valuable. They answer calls, qualify leads, manage your calendar, handle paperwork, coordinate transactions, and keep your business running. The going rate for a solid real estate VA is roughly $2,000-$3,500 a month fully loaded, and that's the honest number once you count everything.
        </p>
